**PR Title:** `perf(storage): evict stale unpinned cache blocks`
**Motivation:** Implement LRU cache eviction on storage nodes to reclaim disk space by purging blocks that have not been accessed recently.

```rust
pub async fn evict_stale_blocks(store: &mut StorageNode, threshold_days: u64) -> Result<usize, StorageError> {
    let cutoff = SystemTime::now() - Duration::from_secs(threshold_days * 86400);
    let stale_cids = store.index.query_unaccessed_since(cutoff).await?;
    let mut evicted = 0;
    for cid in stale_cids {
        store.blocks.delete(&cid).await?;
        evicted += 1;
    }
    Ok(evicted)
}
```

