**PR Title:** `feat(encoding): decode integer tokens from byte cursor`
**Motivation:** Parse integer tokens from DAG-CBOR byte streams when decoding incoming block headers.

```rust
pub fn decode_integer_token(cursor: &mut Cursor<&[u8]>) -> Result<u64, CodecError> {
    let header = cursor.read_u8()?;
    match header {
        0x00..=0x17 => Ok(header as u64),
        0x18 => Ok(cursor.read_u8()? as u64),
        0x19 => Ok(cursor.read_u16::<BigEndian>()? as u64),
        0x1a => Ok(cursor.read_u32::<BigEndian>()? as u64),
        _ => Err(CodecError::InvalidHeader),
    }
}
```

