**PR Title:** `refactor(manifest): compute manifest header hash`
**Motivation:** Hash graph_id, content_root, parents, identity_anchor, and author public key into the manifest header identifier.

```rust
pub fn compute_header_id(header: &ManifestHeader, author: &SigningPublicKey) -> ManifestId {
    let mut hasher = Sha256::new();
    hasher.update(header.graph_id.as_bytes());
    hasher.update(header.content_root.as_ref());
    for parent in &header.parents {
        hasher.update(parent.as_ref());
    }
    hasher.update(header.identity_anchor.as_ref());
    hasher.update(author.as_bytes());
    hasher.update(header.created_at.to_le_bytes());
    ManifestId::from_sha256(&hasher.finalize())
}
```

